-- stage 22 of the quine relay (Lean 4, the language the relay is proved in)
-- run: lean --run stage22.lean > stage23.wat
-- This is the self-hosting stage: the assistant that proves the relay closes
-- is also one of the programs that runs it.
-- The payload is one list literal; a long one needs elaboration room.
